[[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p><a href=\"#/3025566\">5540E10</a></p><p>1. Unscrew the bolts</p><p>2. Remove the bulb holder and bulb.</p><p>3. Remove the bulb (bayonet fitting).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/2005025.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[31,63,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Check the operation of the\nbulb.</p><p>Refit the bulb in the bulb holder.</p><p>Refit the bulb holder and secure it using\nthe bolts.</p><p><a href=\"#/3025566\">5540E10</a></p><p>Check the operation of the rear fog lamps.</p>"]]